third-party

--- code ---

test/uu.l, the ported section only (from "UniMath Foundations PartA")
  Copyright (c) 2015 the UniMath Development Team.
  MIT License. https://github.com/UniMath/UniMath
  Definitions and theorem statements from Foundations/PartA.v et al, ported to
  uu's surface with the original names.


--- data ---

src/apps/tls/roots.pem
  Mozilla's CA certificate program: the roots trusted for serving tls, as extracted
  from NSS's certdata.txt by curl (https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html), verbatim.
  Mozilla Public License 2.0. https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/


--- fonts ---

src/love/quay/cga_8x8.c
  Public domain. Letters, digits and Latin-1 from font8x8 by Daniel Hepper
  (https://github.com/dhepper/font8x8), after Marcel Sondaar's copy of IBM's
  public domain VGA fonts; pictures, box lines, blocks and maths from unscii-8
  by viznut (http://viznut.fi/unscii/). Four glyphs drawn for the tree.

src/love/quay/cleat_8x16.c
  Terminus Font, Copyright (c) 2020 Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov,
  with Reserved Font Name "Terminus Font".
  SIL Open Font License 1.1. https://terminus-font.sourceforge.net/
  The cp437 console face (ter-i16n.psf) re-laid on quay's page order by
  src/tools/mkpsf.l. A modified version may not wear the reserved name, so the
  table is named for the tree.


--- music ---

src/apps/lore/grass.l, the `score` list
  "Toy Soldiers", written by Martika and Michael Jay, 1988.
  The tune the music box plays is an arrangement by ear of its chorus melody.
